SUMMARY:Deadline 14:00 CET: EMAP / EMARE: European Media Art Platform Resid
 encies 2027
DESCRIPTION:Closes 06 Nov 2026 at 14:00 CET.\n\nThe European Media Art Plat
 form (EMAP/EMARE) is a network of leading European media-art organisations
  offering fully funded two-month production residencies for artists workin
 g with digital media\, including media art\, bio art and robotic art.\n\nO
 rganisation: European Media Art Platform (EMAP / EMARE)\nLocation: Two-mon
 th production residency at one of 15 host institutions across Austria\, Fr
 ance\, Slovakia\, Portugal\, Belgium\, Netherlands\, Slovenia\, Croatia\, 
 Spain\, Italy\, Cyprus\, Greece\, Latvia\, Germany and Poland\nAward: EUR 
 4\,000 grant for the applying artist (including subsistence)\; EUR 2\,000 
 for a collaborating artist (EUR 6\,000 total for a duo)\; EUR 4\,000 proje
 ct budget\; accommodation provided by the host\; travel covered per EU cei
 lings\; access to technical facilities and media labs. No application fee.
 \nDuration: Two months\n\nMore: https://call.emare.eu/?utm_source=artifici
 alnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
