 lected for a 7-to-30-day residency during March 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Cul
 tivamos Cultura (European OASis project)\nLocation: Sao Luis\, Odemira\, P
 ortugal. Open to international applicants.\nAward: EUR 1\,300 project fee\
 , travel budget up to EUR 500\, production and material expenses up to EUR
